WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.400
Gracias.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.080
What?

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.560
Wait.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.280
You need to explain

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.960
this to me, Walt.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.520
In a week,

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.000
your body should react

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.040
if conception took place.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.640
I believe it did.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.760
Oh, what the hell?

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.000
I mean, you...

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.800
you planed all this?

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.640
Is that so bad?

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:29.840
I want to bring

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.840
the doctor's note and

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.520
wave it in my father's face.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.160
And you didn't think

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.640
to ask me about this?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.960
I didn't give my consent to this.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.360
Listen, Gina.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.120
If you get in bed with me

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.480
without protection,

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.000
that's consent,

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.320
isn't it?

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.240
No.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.720
This is...

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.840
this is my body

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.560
and... and my choice.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.760
Okay.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.680
Get out of here, Henderson.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:03.840
I...

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:04.560
I didn't have

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:05.720
any problems

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.920
before I knew you.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:10.800
Well,

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.200
that's not entirely true.
